{"seq":50,"slug":"mlops-platform","title":"MLOps 平台工程","stage":"DONE","category":"data-science","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/mlops-platform","rating":{"composite":4.08,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.2,"coverage":3.75,"positioning":4,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"mlops-平台工程\">MLOps 平台工程</h1><p>将机器学习模型从实验笔记本推向可靠的生产系统，这件事在 2026 年仍然让超过 60% 的团队头疼。MLOps 平台工程正是解决这一痛点的工程学科——它把 DevOps 的自动化理念、SRE 的可靠性实践与机器学习特有的数据-模型-代码三重版本化需求融合为一套端到端平台。</p>\n<p>本 hub 聚焦于<strong>平台层面的系统设计与工程落地</strong>，而非单一工具的使用教程。它与同类 hub 的分工如下：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>MLOps 模型部署</strong>（<code>21_mlops-model-deployment</code>）侧重模型从训练到上线的基础流程和单点工具操作；</li>\n<li><strong>数据漂移与模型监控</strong>（<code>28_data-drift-model-monitoring</code>）深入漂移检测算法与告警策略；</li>\n<li><strong>特征存储工程</strong>（<code>30_feature-stores-engineering</code>）专注特征计算、存储与服务一致性；</li>\n<li><strong>本 hub</strong> 则站在平台架构师的视角，将上述能力编排为一个内聚的自服务平台——涵盖流水线编排、服务治理、LLMOps 新范式与组织级成熟度演进。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"推荐学习路径\">推荐学习路径</h2><p>对于有 3-7 年经验的后端/平台工程师，建议按以下顺序推进：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>基础篇</strong>：理解 MLOps 演进脉络、ML 系统设计原则、成熟度模型——建立全局心智模型。</li>\n<li><strong>流水线篇</strong>：掌握实验追踪（MLflow 3）、流水线编排（Kubeflow/ZenML）、ML CI/CD——这是平台的&quot;骨架&quot;。</li>\n<li><strong>服务篇</strong>：学习模型服务模式、推理优化、灰度部署——让模型可靠地跑在生产流量上。</li>\n<li><strong>平台篇</strong>：设计内部 ML 平台、引入 LLMOps 新实践、落地治理与 FinOps——面向组织规模化。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>如果你是数据科学家而非平台工程师，建议先完成 <code>21_mlops-model-deployment</code> 的基础篇，再回到本 hub 的第二章起步。</p>\n<h2 id=\"前置知识\">前置知识</h2><ul>\n<li>容器化与 Kubernetes 基础（Pod/Service/Deployment 概念）</li>\n<li>CI/CD 流水线经验（GitHub Actions / GitLab CI / Jenkins 任一）</li>\n<li>Python 机器学习基础（scikit-learn 或 PyTorch 训练过一个模型）</li>\n<li>REST API 设计与微服务基本概念</li>\n</ul>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础篇","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/mlops-platform/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"mlops-evolution-landscape","title":"MLOps 演进与生态全景","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/mlops-platform/foundations/mlops-evolution-landscape"},{"seq":2,"slug":"ml-system-design-principles","title":"ML 系统设计原则","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/mlops-platform/foundations/ml-system-design-principles"},{"seq":3,"slug":"maturity-model-assessment","title":"MLOps 成熟度模型与评估","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/mlops-platform/foundations/maturity-model-assessment"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"pipeline","title":"流水线篇","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/mlops-platform/pipeline","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"experiment-tracking-mlflow3","title":"实验追踪与 MLflow 3","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/mlops-platform/pipeline/experiment-tracking-mlflow3"},{"seq":2,"slug":"pipeline-orchestration","title":"流水线编排与调度","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/mlops-platform/pipeline/pipeline-orchestration"},{"seq":3,"slug":"ci-cd-for-ml","title":"ML 持续集成与交付","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/mlops-platform/pipeline/ci-cd-for-ml"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"serving","title":"服务篇","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/mlops-platform/serving","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"model-serving-patterns","title":"模型服务架构模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/mlops-platform/serving/model-serving-patterns"},{"seq":2,"slug":"inference-optimization","title":"推理优化与加速","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/mlops-platform/serving/inference-optimization"},{"seq":3,"slug":"canary-ab-deployment","title":"金丝雀与 A/B 部署策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/mlops-platform/serving/canary-ab-deployment"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"platform","title":"平台篇","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/mlops-platform/platform","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"internal-ml-platform","title":"企业内部 ML 平台设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/mlops-platform/platform/internal-ml-platform"},{"seq":2,"slug":"llmops-genai-operations","title":"LLMOps 与 GenAI 运维","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/mlops-platform/platform/llmops-genai-operations"},{"seq":3,"slug":"governance-compliance","title":"治理合规与成本优化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/mlops-platform/platform/governance-compliance"}]}]}